WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.895
"Let's race!" Zippy said.

2
00:00:10.896 --> 00:00:21.323
He zoomed off.

3
00:00:21.324 --> 00:00:27.390
Eddy drove fast.

4
00:00:27.391 --> 00:00:34.550
He zipped around a bend.

5
00:00:34.551 --> 00:00:38.820
Eddy saw Zippy.

6
00:00:38.821 --> 00:00:43.890
Zippy was reading another sign.

7
00:00:43.891 --> 00:00:48.768
Everyone else stopped.

8
00:00:48.769 --> 00:00:53.063
"What does the sign say?" Gasser asked.

9
00:00:53.064 --> 00:00:59.479
"It says, 'Dig!'" Zippy said.

10
00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:02.597
"Hmm," Poppy said.

11
00:01:02.598 --> 00:01:10.207
"Where will we dig?"

12
00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:13.460
"I know where to dig," Jeb said.

13
00:01:13.461 --> 00:01:20.747
"At the construction site!"

14
00:01:20.748 --> 00:01:37.075
Everyone went to the construction site.

15
00:01:37.076 --> 00:01:50.216
Jeb dug.

16
00:01:50.217 --> 00:01:53.814
He dug deep.

17
00:01:53.815 --> 00:01:58.531
He dug up a box.

18
00:01:58.532 --> 00:02:01.402
Poppy opened the box.

19
00:02:01.403 --> 00:02:04.205
"It's a horn," she said.

20
00:02:04.206 --> 00:02:06.846
"Another clue," Eddy said.

21
00:02:06.847 --> 00:02:11.662
"Honk the horn, Poppy."

22
00:02:11.663 --> 00:02:21.337
Honk! Poppy honked the horn.

23
00:02:21.338 --> 00:02:24.712
Nothing happened.

24
00:02:24.713 --> 00:02:27.696
Eddy sighed.

25
00:02:27.697 --> 00:02:32.222
"Now what do we do?"

